<title>JAPAN: Sony - 2qtr group results.</title>
<headline>Sony - 2qtr group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.36 trln	 vs	    1.17 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   80.61		vs	   64.84</p>
<p> Pretax		65.67		vs	   18.56</p>
<p> Net		   34.64		vs	    8.61</p>
<p>NOTE - Sony Corp is a large manufacturer of consumer electronics.</p>
